WEBVTT

00:00:00.403 --> 00:00:05.544
Pick Hold and Spin for a board of cells, where coins land, lock, and count into the win.

00:00:05.904 --> 00:00:09.637
The first round is the start board: the coins that trigger the feature.

00:00:09.994 --> 00:00:12.395
Pick a coin, then click cells to place it.

00:00:12.395 --> 00:00:14.282
The same coin again takes it off.

00:00:14.641 --> 00:00:17.104
Each respin spins only the empty cells.

00:00:17.104 --> 00:00:19.377
The coins already there stay locked.

00:00:19.731 --> 00:00:21.885
Place the coins that land on this respin.

00:00:22.245 --> 00:00:25.658
Tease picks cells that stop last, crawling in one by one.

00:00:26.010 --> 00:00:29.360
When a coin lands, the respins counter goes back to three.

00:00:30.713 --> 00:00:34.357
The collect counts every coin into the win, in the stop order.

00:00:34.357 --> 00:00:36.003
A full board adds the Grand.

00:00:39.366 --> 00:00:41.160
Down the right are the coins.

00:00:41.160 --> 00:00:44.934
Each value is a piece of art with its own Idle and Win comps.

00:00:45.290 --> 00:00:49.343
Add a value here, or a new type of coin, and replace any art with your own.
